WEBVTT

00:35:27.345 --> 00:35:31.056
is to understand
that bad things can happen.

00:35:31.080 --> 00:35:32.604
We don't have control over them,

00:35:32.628 --> 00:35:34.826
but we still have to be prepared for them.

00:35:34.850 --> 00:35:37.225
AG: Some psychologists
recommend a simple strategy

00:35:37.249 --> 00:35:38.996
for preventing rumination:

00:35:39.020 --> 00:35:41.546
adding worry time to your daily schedule.

00:35:41.570 --> 00:35:46.806
SK: Schedule time for your rumination,
15 minutes, maybe.

00:35:46.830 --> 00:35:51.666
Doing that will make
the days go by so much quicker

00:35:51.690 --> 00:35:57.252
rather than just sitting there thinking
about what you're going to do next

00:35:57.276 --> 00:35:59.746
and bingeing on Netflix all day.

00:35:59.770 --> 00:36:01.587
AG: When I went through this exercise,